    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c5f5fa00-ed51-585b-9b58-af9d675bb891" activityNameId="d215c620-15ba-5150-afd6-a02050cac125" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solid bleached board, SBB, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solid bleached board, SBB, at plant
na;
Synonyms: GZ; 
UUID: 93c68a97-84f6-3d12-95ff-94b3af1229f2
This module includes the European production of solid bleached board (SBB) in a mix of integrated and non-integrated mills - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching rsp. pulp handling, board production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a finnish database and from the CER of one European producer used as European average data.
Location:  Data from a finnish database and from the CER of one European producer used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European boxboard production in 2000: 11'664 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Assumption made that 75% are produced in integrated mills and 25% in non-integrated mills.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_93c68a97-84f6-3d12-95ff-94b3af1229f2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
